1
00:00:16,534 --> 00:00:22,869
(Firefly Theater)

2
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:47,392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

3
00:00:49,024 --> 00:00:52,608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

4
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

5
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:58,656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

6
00:00:59,488 --> 00:01:02,080
♪I've seen this game before♪

7
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

8
00:01:04,768 --> 00:01:07,168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

9
00:01:07,552 --> 00:01:10,304
♪Just an empty shell♪

10
00:01:10,624 --> 00:01:13,440
♪I've broken this game before♪

11
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

12
00:01:15,872 --> 00:01:18,016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

13
00:01:18,208 --> 00:01:25,056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

14
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:28,256
♪When I stand back up again♪

15
00:01:28,544 --> 00:01:30,400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

16
00:01:31,264 --> 00:01:33,952
♪For the part you owe me♪

17
00:01:34,112 --> 00:01:41,088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

18
00:01:42,624 --> 00:01:47,360
♪You're just my starting point♪

19
00:01:51,712 --> 00:01:52,739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

20
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,720
=Episode 15=

21
00:01:58,408 --> 00:01:59,048
Haoyu,

22
00:01:59,367 --> 00:02:00,408
I'm heading to work.

23
00:02:22,145 --> 00:02:23,032
(Lu Hui)

24
00:02:27,157 --> 00:02:28,422
(Lucky Beauty Yu)

25
00:02:28,422 --> 00:02:29,790
(Lu Hui)

26
00:02:31,167 --> 00:02:31,927
Wait,

27
00:02:34,207 --> 00:02:35,088
before the divorce,

28
00:02:36,727 --> 00:02:38,008
Dad was already dating Yu Meng.

29
00:02:43,368 --> 00:02:43,887
Dr. Kang.

30
00:02:43,927 --> 00:02:44,968
The lab budget approval

31
00:02:45,088 --> 00:02:45,808
has been stalled.

32
00:02:46,128 --> 00:02:46,968
I urged for times,

33
00:02:47,288 --> 00:02:47,808
and was told

34
00:02:47,848 --> 00:02:48,727
it's because of you.

35
00:02:49,408 --> 00:02:50,088
You promised me

36
00:02:50,447 --> 00:02:51,647
your internal power struggles

37
00:02:51,688 --> 00:02:52,647
wouldn't affect my lab.

38
00:02:52,927 --> 00:02:53,968
What is this about?

39
00:02:54,927 --> 00:02:55,568
I haven't gotten

40
00:02:55,607 --> 00:02:56,688
any approval documents.

41
00:02:57,487 --> 00:02:58,207
Could there be

42
00:02:58,207 --> 00:02:59,167
a misunderstanding?

43
00:02:59,248 --> 00:03:00,128
Don't worry.

44
00:03:00,368 --> 00:03:01,327
I'll check with Finance.

45
00:03:12,727 --> 00:03:13,927
Before the funds arrive,

46
00:03:14,368 --> 00:03:14,927
the lab

47
00:03:15,288 --> 00:03:16,688
will halt all the development.

48
00:03:18,968 --> 00:03:19,767
I'll get to it now.

49
00:03:22,248 --> 00:03:22,968
Come in.

50
00:03:25,047 --> 00:03:25,607
Why hold up

51
00:03:25,688 --> 00:03:26,927
the lab budget approval?

52
00:03:31,927 --> 00:03:32,767
It's you?

53
00:03:35,008 --> 00:03:36,487
A wise bird chooses its perch.

54
00:03:37,368 --> 00:03:38,767
You should understand that, Ms. Yu.

55
00:03:42,408 --> 00:03:43,848
Give me the lab budget approval.

56
00:03:44,167 --> 00:03:45,248
I'm signing it right now.

57
00:03:46,968 --> 00:03:48,528
Ms. Yu, you might not know

58
00:03:49,128 --> 00:03:49,887
that Finance

59
00:03:49,887 --> 00:03:50,927
has procedures.

60
00:03:51,047 --> 00:03:51,887
One at a time.

61
00:03:52,327 --> 00:03:53,607
First come, first served,

62
00:03:53,688 --> 00:03:54,128
right?

63
00:03:54,927 --> 00:03:56,088
You need to approve

64
00:03:56,128 --> 00:03:57,808
Jinghua's production increase first

65
00:03:58,288 --> 00:03:59,447
before we process

66
00:03:59,447 --> 00:04:00,167
the lab budget.

67
00:04:02,008 --> 00:04:02,727
Fine.

68
00:04:03,248 --> 00:04:04,727
Lecturing me on procedures, are you?

69
00:04:05,688 --> 00:04:07,128
Either give me the approval,

70
00:04:07,487 --> 00:04:08,128
or

71
00:04:09,415 --> 00:04:09,848
(Resignation Form)

72
00:04:09,848 --> 00:04:11,167
sign this and get lost now.

73
00:04:11,808 --> 00:04:12,248
Mr. Di,

74
00:04:12,727 --> 00:04:14,447
should we process Dr. Kang's approval

75
00:04:14,487 --> 00:04:15,327
first?

76
00:04:15,568 --> 00:04:16,168
No need.

77
00:04:17,008 --> 00:04:18,327
Company funds are tight now.

78
00:04:18,887 --> 00:04:20,368
Jinghua gets top priority.

79
00:04:20,647 --> 00:04:21,087
By the way,

80
00:04:21,967 --> 00:04:23,048
as your instructions,

81
00:04:23,373 --> 00:04:23,847
(Resignation Form)

82
00:04:23,847 --> 00:04:25,368
for the sake of the company,

83
00:04:25,847 --> 00:04:27,128
I completely offended Ms. Yu

84
00:04:27,168 --> 00:04:27,928
this time.

85
00:04:28,048 --> 00:04:29,128
She wants to fire me.

86
00:04:29,568 --> 00:04:30,128
Don't worry.

87
00:04:31,128 --> 00:04:31,887
You report

88
00:04:32,207 --> 00:04:33,128
directly to me.

89
00:04:34,608 --> 00:04:35,207
Okay.

90
00:04:35,488 --> 00:04:36,287
I'm out then.

91
00:04:45,207 --> 00:04:46,087
I'm truly sorry,

92
00:04:46,128 --> 00:04:46,688
Dr. Kang.

93
00:04:47,207 --> 00:04:48,407
Please give me some time.

94
00:04:58,527 --> 00:04:59,608
Is everything ready?

95
00:05:00,767 --> 00:05:01,368
Remember,

96
00:05:02,407 --> 00:05:04,568
push Yu Meng
until she completely breaks down.

97
00:05:04,728 --> 00:05:06,128
Meng is in a dilemma.

98
00:05:06,327 --> 00:05:07,887
Can you give her a bit more time?

99
00:05:08,287 --> 00:05:09,647
We'll definitely be grateful.

100
00:05:12,407 --> 00:05:13,048
I'm hungry.

101
00:05:13,967 --> 00:05:15,207
I'll make you something to eat.

102
00:05:23,008 --> 00:05:24,287
What do you usually eat?

103
00:05:24,967 --> 00:05:25,688
Takeout.

104
00:05:30,647 --> 00:05:31,207
Let's go.

105
00:05:32,608 --> 00:05:33,287
Where to?

106
00:05:47,248 --> 00:05:48,568
When did you grab this?

107
00:05:50,608 --> 00:05:51,928
I thought Chestnut would like it.

108
00:05:52,603 --> 00:05:54,399
(Anpanman Cookies)

109
00:06:10,688 --> 00:06:11,407
Eat up.

110
00:06:47,407 --> 00:06:48,488
School is about to over.

111
00:06:49,168 --> 00:06:50,134
Let's pick up Chestnut.

112
00:06:50,407 --> 00:06:50,967
Sure.

113
00:06:55,008 --> 00:06:55,688
As for Yu Meng,

114
00:06:56,767 --> 00:06:57,368
I saw her

115
00:06:57,407 --> 00:06:58,407
arguing with Wu Heng.

116
00:06:59,008 --> 00:06:59,728
She's trying hard

117
00:06:59,767 --> 00:07:00,488
to resolve it.

118
00:07:01,087 --> 00:07:02,287
I can give her more time,

119
00:07:02,928 --> 00:07:03,728
but at the office,

120
00:07:03,967 --> 00:07:05,248
I have to show my attitude.

121
00:07:06,847 --> 00:07:08,447
Your acting was pretty convincing.

122
00:07:09,928 --> 00:07:10,928
I thank you for her.

123
00:07:27,568 --> 00:07:28,368
Look at you.

124
00:07:28,647 --> 00:07:29,368
Hit a wall again?

125
00:07:35,967 --> 00:07:36,808
Di Liren sent Wu Heng

126
00:07:36,887 --> 00:07:38,008
to the Finance

127
00:07:38,568 --> 00:07:39,847
to replace Mr. Dong.

128
00:07:40,647 --> 00:07:41,368
And he cut off

129
00:07:41,407 --> 00:07:42,447
the funding for the lab.

130
00:07:42,647 --> 00:07:44,128
I have the signing authority,

131
00:07:44,368 --> 00:07:45,527
but if Finance disapproves,

132
00:07:45,608 --> 00:07:46,488
I can't do anything.

133
00:07:48,048 --> 00:07:49,248
Di Liren doesn't

134
00:07:49,327 --> 00:07:50,248
hide anymore,

135
00:07:50,688 --> 00:07:51,608
and plays it straight.

136
00:07:52,128 --> 00:07:52,967
Exactly.

137
00:07:54,128 --> 00:07:55,688
I even used a resignation letter

138
00:07:55,887 --> 00:07:57,608
to force Wu Heng.

139
00:07:57,967 --> 00:07:59,327
I knew Wu Heng wouldn't sign it,

140
00:07:59,568 --> 00:08:00,327
and Di Liren

141
00:08:00,368 --> 00:08:01,168
would protect him.

142
00:08:01,488 --> 00:08:02,087
But I had to

143
00:08:02,128 --> 00:08:03,207
show Dr. Kang

144
00:08:03,447 --> 00:08:05,008
my determination to resolve this.

145
00:08:05,287 --> 00:08:06,327
What did Liu Zi say?

146
00:08:06,568 --> 00:08:09,128
She definitely defends me.

147
00:08:10,128 --> 00:08:11,248
She should've talked

148
00:08:11,287 --> 00:08:11,928
to Kang Long.

149
00:08:12,248 --> 00:08:14,207
Your signing authority
becomes useless now.

150
00:08:14,527 --> 00:08:15,447
I think Di Liren wants

151
00:08:15,488 --> 00:08:16,327
to tell you this.

152
00:08:17,087 --> 00:08:17,967
Whatever.

153
00:08:18,447 --> 00:08:19,128
I don't care

154
00:08:19,168 --> 00:08:20,168
about him anymore.

155
00:08:22,168 --> 00:08:23,688
All I want right now is to get

156
00:08:23,767 --> 00:08:24,928
the test results for Jinghua.

157
00:08:25,688 --> 00:08:26,728
The test results

158
00:08:26,887 --> 00:08:28,207
will take at least three days.

159
00:08:28,327 --> 00:08:29,688
You must keep your composure.

160
00:08:30,368 --> 00:08:31,128
Chips, five yuan.

161
00:08:31,808 --> 00:08:32,647
Scan here to pay.

162
00:08:39,208 --> 00:08:40,368
Right, and a Coke.

163
00:08:40,687 --> 00:08:41,407
Two yuan.

164
00:08:42,608 --> 00:08:42,968
You...

165
00:08:45,088 --> 00:08:45,767
I don't want it.

166
00:08:54,407 --> 00:08:55,407
(Jiali, Pay Us Back)
Jiali, pay us back!

167
00:08:55,887 --> 00:08:57,128
Jiali, pay us back!

168
00:08:57,287 --> 00:08:58,328
Jiali, pay us back!

169
00:08:58,488 --> 00:08:59,088
Excuse me.

170
00:08:59,088 --> 00:09:00,047
Jiali, pay us back!

171
00:09:00,608 --> 00:09:01,407
Jiali, pay us back!

172
00:09:01,407 --> 00:09:02,488
Ma'am.

173
00:09:02,927 --> 00:09:04,047
What's going on here?

174
00:09:04,208 --> 00:09:05,287
You're that Ms. Yu!

175
00:09:05,767 --> 00:09:06,368
Pay us back!

176
00:09:06,807 --> 00:09:08,128
You're holding our payments!

177
00:09:09,167 --> 00:09:10,208
What do you mean?

178
00:09:10,208 --> 00:09:10,887
What payments?

179
00:09:10,968 --> 00:09:12,208
If you don't pay the factory,

180
00:09:12,287 --> 00:09:13,608
and the factory won't pay us.

181
00:09:13,848 --> 00:09:14,567
How are us small vendors

182
00:09:14,567 --> 00:09:15,488
supposed to survive?

183
00:09:15,647 --> 00:09:16,448
Pay us now,

184
00:09:16,448 --> 00:09:17,128
or you won't go.

185
00:09:17,128 --> 00:09:18,328
Ma'am, let's talk this out.

186
00:09:20,927 --> 00:09:22,008
Don't touch me!

187
00:09:22,047 --> 00:09:23,328
I've got nothing to lose anyway!

188
00:09:23,728 --> 00:09:24,807
You make us do this!

189
00:09:25,527 --> 00:09:26,448
Put the knife down,

190
00:09:26,687 --> 00:09:27,088
please.

191
00:09:27,088 --> 00:09:27,968
Pay us first!

192
00:09:28,047 --> 00:09:29,047
Put the knife down first.

193
00:09:29,287 --> 00:09:29,767
Let me go.

194
00:09:30,008 --> 00:09:31,248
I'll take you upstairs

195
00:09:31,328 --> 00:09:32,047
to pay you.

196
00:09:32,167 --> 00:09:33,088
I'm not going with you.

197
00:09:33,407 --> 00:09:34,368
Everyone's here.

198
00:09:34,728 --> 00:09:36,208
I need them to witness this.

199
00:09:36,488 --> 00:09:37,208
You make the call.

200
00:09:44,448 --> 00:09:45,088
Ma'am,

201
00:09:45,368 --> 00:09:46,208
listen to me.

202
00:09:46,767 --> 00:09:48,167
Security already called the police.

203
00:09:48,407 --> 00:09:49,527
The police will arrive soon.

204
00:09:49,807 --> 00:09:51,167
I won't withhold your money.

205
00:09:52,287 --> 00:09:53,567
Just put the knife down.

206
00:09:53,687 --> 00:09:54,287
Let me go.

207
00:09:54,488 --> 00:09:55,567
I'll take you upstairs

208
00:09:55,647 --> 00:09:56,647
to pay you,

209
00:09:57,047 --> 00:09:57,527
okay?

210
00:09:57,767 --> 00:09:59,088
If I'm lying to you,

211
00:09:59,287 --> 00:10:00,208
you can come every day.

212
00:10:04,728 --> 00:10:05,328
Let go!

213
00:10:05,328 --> 00:10:06,248
- What are you doing?
- Hey, what are you doing?

214
00:10:06,328 --> 00:10:07,167
- Don't move!
- Don't move!

215
00:10:19,128 --> 00:10:19,687
Be careful.

216
00:10:34,328 --> 00:10:35,608
Did he think I would give up

217
00:10:35,687 --> 00:10:37,167
the signing authority over this?

218
00:10:37,968 --> 00:10:39,088
Never.

219
00:10:39,407 --> 00:10:40,647
Di Liren is so shameless.

220
00:10:40,887 --> 00:10:41,848
He's more despicable

221
00:10:41,968 --> 00:10:42,767
than I imagined.

222
00:10:43,047 --> 00:10:44,328
Just let your imagination run

223
00:10:44,807 --> 00:10:45,927
even wilder with him.

224
00:10:46,287 --> 00:10:46,848
How is it?

225
00:10:47,088 --> 00:10:47,807
Are you okay?

226
00:10:50,848 --> 00:10:51,728
It stinks.

227
00:10:52,407 --> 00:10:53,608
The smell still lingers.

228
00:10:53,968 --> 00:10:54,608
Smell this.

229
00:10:55,047 --> 00:10:55,887
I'll pass.

230
00:10:57,248 --> 00:10:58,248
Take this first.

231
00:10:58,687 --> 00:10:59,527
Don't collapse before

232
00:10:59,608 --> 00:11:00,488
the real deal begins.

233
00:11:01,488 --> 00:11:02,848
What's this?

234
00:11:03,088 --> 00:11:04,008
I'd like some too.

235
00:11:04,047 --> 00:11:04,728
What for?

236
00:11:04,927 --> 00:11:05,683
Get to the point.

237
00:11:05,848 --> 00:11:06,567
Right. Meng,

238
00:11:07,047 --> 00:11:07,927
the test results...

239
00:11:08,887 --> 00:11:09,968
Keep your voice down.

240
00:11:10,608 --> 00:11:11,848
The test results are out.

241
00:11:17,538 --> 00:11:19,096
(Test Report)

242
00:11:21,128 --> 00:11:22,287
The key active ingredient,

243
00:11:22,527 --> 00:11:23,647
hydroxytyrosol,

244
00:11:23,767 --> 00:11:25,128
wasn't detected at all.

245
00:11:25,368 --> 00:11:26,876
And preservatives exceeded the limit.

246
00:11:27,647 --> 00:11:28,887
That's so outrageous.

247
00:11:29,328 --> 00:11:29,968
It's the product

248
00:11:30,047 --> 00:11:31,167
Jiali is promoting hard.

249
00:11:31,407 --> 00:11:32,008
Can this report

250
00:11:32,088 --> 00:11:33,167
put Di Liren and Han Guang

251
00:11:33,248 --> 00:11:34,128
behind bars?

252
00:11:35,368 --> 00:11:35,968
No.

253
00:11:36,887 --> 00:11:38,008
Private testing carries

254
00:11:38,128 --> 00:11:39,047
little legal weight.

255
00:11:39,887 --> 00:11:40,448
Besides,

256
00:11:40,608 --> 00:11:42,128
this report can only be a lead,

257
00:11:42,248 --> 00:11:43,088
not a proof of guilt.

258
00:11:43,368 --> 00:11:44,167
Di Liren can claim

259
00:11:44,167 --> 00:11:45,248
the sample got tampered.

260
00:11:46,047 --> 00:11:47,488
We need stronger evidence

261
00:11:47,647 --> 00:11:48,488
to prove Di Liren

262
00:11:48,567 --> 00:11:49,368
is related to this.

263
00:11:49,647 --> 00:11:50,328
Bai,

264
00:11:51,728 --> 00:11:52,728
your clothes fit well.

265
00:11:57,728 --> 00:11:58,328
Meng,

266
00:11:58,807 --> 00:11:59,887
is your work

267
00:12:00,488 --> 00:12:01,328
that dangerous?

268
00:12:02,328 --> 00:12:03,088
Not at all.

269
00:12:03,767 --> 00:12:04,608
It was just today.

270
00:12:04,728 --> 00:12:05,608
And you ran into it.

271
00:12:06,448 --> 00:12:06,848
Harry,

272
00:12:07,767 --> 00:12:08,767
about today,

273
00:12:09,128 --> 00:12:09,848
thank you.

274
00:12:12,728 --> 00:12:13,248
Meng,

275
00:12:13,968 --> 00:12:14,567
I'm sorry.

276
00:12:15,407 --> 00:12:16,287
What's this about?

277
00:12:16,767 --> 00:12:17,687
Why apologize?

278
00:12:17,968 --> 00:12:19,047
I have a friend.

279
00:12:19,608 --> 00:12:20,287
His parents are

280
00:12:20,368 --> 00:12:21,088
quite in love,

281
00:12:21,167 --> 00:12:22,167
but he just discovered

282
00:12:23,128 --> 00:12:24,448
his dad started another family

283
00:12:24,968 --> 00:12:26,088
with a new identity.

284
00:12:27,567 --> 00:12:29,088
His parents kept it from him

285
00:12:30,407 --> 00:12:31,848
probably to protect him.

286
00:12:34,807 --> 00:12:36,248
Did your friend

287
00:12:37,527 --> 00:12:38,527
never notice

288
00:12:38,647 --> 00:12:39,527
any signs?

289
00:12:40,887 --> 00:12:41,647
A while ago,

290
00:12:42,328 --> 00:12:43,128
his parents even

291
00:12:43,167 --> 00:12:44,167
talked about emigration.

292
00:12:44,927 --> 00:12:45,728
What does he think?

293
00:12:46,088 --> 00:12:47,407
He just wants the truth.

294
00:12:49,448 --> 00:12:51,047
But is knowing the truth good?

295
00:12:51,608 --> 00:12:52,368
You have to know,

296
00:12:53,128 --> 00:12:54,008
in any relationship,

297
00:12:54,807 --> 00:12:56,008
once trust is broken,

298
00:12:56,968 --> 00:12:58,488
