Cut the flattery.

597
00:23:21,648 --> 00:23:22,287
I'm telling you,

598
00:23:23,248 --> 00:23:24,728
even if we can't leave unscathed

599
00:23:25,208 --> 00:23:26,408
and must fight to the death,

600
00:23:26,488 --> 00:23:27,248
I can accept that.

601
00:23:27,847 --> 00:23:28,567
But I can't let

602
00:23:28,607 --> 00:23:29,527
her to use Haoyu again.

603
00:23:31,127 --> 00:23:32,287
The life Haoyu has now

604
00:23:32,527 --> 00:23:33,327
is the life

605
00:23:33,367 --> 00:23:34,488
he was always meant to have.

606
00:23:36,208 --> 00:23:36,968
He can't go back

607
00:23:37,008 --> 00:23:38,087
to that old life anymore.

608
00:23:38,448 --> 00:23:38,847
Alright.

609
00:23:39,488 --> 00:23:40,047
This time,

610
00:23:40,567 --> 00:23:41,888
I have a permanent solution.

611
00:23:42,807 --> 00:23:43,488
Even if she wants

612
00:23:43,488 --> 00:23:44,607
to go against us,

613
00:23:44,968 --> 00:23:46,127
she won't have the power.

614
00:23:50,168 --> 00:23:50,767
(Wuyou Moving)
Excuse me.

615
00:23:51,087 --> 00:23:51,607
Excuse me.

616
00:23:52,087 --> 00:23:53,208
What are you doing?

617
00:23:54,047 --> 00:23:54,688
Ms. Yu,

618
00:23:54,807 --> 00:23:55,287
right?

619
00:23:56,047 --> 00:23:57,688
We're from Wuyou Moving Company.

620
00:23:57,847 --> 00:23:58,888
Happy to be of service.

621
00:23:59,168 --> 00:23:59,928
Moving company?

622
00:24:01,607 --> 00:24:03,047
No one needs to move here.

623
00:24:05,327 --> 00:24:06,448
Building 8, right?

624
00:24:06,607 --> 00:24:07,607
Check if this is

625
00:24:07,607 --> 00:24:08,888
your number and address.

626
00:24:12,847 --> 00:24:13,488
Just a moment.

627
00:24:13,688 --> 00:24:14,047
Sure.

628
00:24:18,791 --> 00:24:22,286
(Di Liren)

629
00:24:25,968 --> 00:24:26,728
The info is right,

630
00:24:27,127 --> 00:24:28,087
but I'd like to know

631
00:24:28,448 --> 00:24:29,168
who ordered this.

632
00:24:29,807 --> 00:24:30,847
It's okay then.

633
00:24:30,928 --> 00:24:31,648
Where should we

634
00:24:31,728 --> 00:24:32,287
start moving?

635
00:24:33,127 --> 00:24:33,888
Let's go in.

636
00:24:33,968 --> 00:24:34,408
Come on.

637
00:24:34,767 --> 00:24:35,928
I never ordered a move.

638
00:24:36,208 --> 00:24:36,888
Don't go in.

639
00:24:36,968 --> 00:24:38,047
Security, stop them!

640
00:24:38,847 --> 00:24:39,527
Stop right there!

641
00:24:39,567 --> 00:24:39,968
Stop it.

642
00:24:40,047 --> 00:24:40,888
Get out!

643
00:24:41,607 --> 00:24:42,168
Get out!

644
00:24:42,408 --> 00:24:43,327
What is going on here?

645
00:24:45,888 --> 00:24:46,607
Ms. Yu,

646
00:24:47,448 --> 00:24:48,847
we normally don't provide

647
00:24:48,968 --> 00:24:49,807
night service.

648
00:24:50,168 --> 00:24:50,888
We only came

649
00:24:50,888 --> 00:24:52,527
at this hour

650
00:24:52,567 --> 00:24:53,648
after confirming

651
00:24:53,688 --> 00:24:54,168
with you.

652
00:24:54,688 --> 00:24:56,087
You can't go back on your word.

653
00:24:56,327 --> 00:24:56,847
Ms. Yu,

654
00:24:57,208 --> 00:24:58,567
maybe check if your family

655
00:24:58,888 --> 00:24:59,888
ordered this.

656
00:25:01,168 --> 00:25:02,448
I make all the decisions.

657
00:25:02,648 --> 00:25:03,847
No one needs to move.

658
00:25:05,767 --> 00:25:07,527
If you really don't want to move, fine.

659
00:25:07,607 --> 00:25:08,607
As we're already here,

660
00:25:08,928 --> 00:25:09,847
you need to pay us.

661
00:25:10,527 --> 00:25:11,408
In the dead of night,

662
00:25:11,448 --> 00:25:12,488
why moving out?

663
00:25:13,047 --> 00:25:13,847
Did she go bankrupt?

664
00:25:14,448 --> 00:25:15,008
Meng,

665
00:25:15,327 --> 00:25:16,807
why are you suddenly moving?

666
00:25:17,127 --> 00:25:18,448
I'm not. Everyone,

667
00:25:18,728 --> 00:25:19,607
they made a mistake.

668
00:25:21,168 --> 00:25:22,448
Why do I need to pay you?

669
00:25:22,648 --> 00:25:24,168
Go ask whoever placed the order.

670
00:25:24,208 --> 00:25:25,168
Trying to blackmail me?

671
00:25:25,287 --> 00:25:25,847
Get lost,

672
00:25:25,928 --> 00:25:26,847
or I'll call the cops.

673
00:25:26,928 --> 00:25:28,168
Call them then, Ms. Yu.

674
00:25:28,648 --> 00:25:29,767
We came here for an order,

675
00:25:29,847 --> 00:25:30,648
completely legally.

676
00:25:30,968 --> 00:25:32,408
Anyway, it's 100 yuan per man,

677
00:25:32,448 --> 00:25:33,168
600 for the truck.

678
00:25:33,168 --> 00:25:33,688
Pay us now,

679
00:25:33,968 --> 00:25:35,208
or we won't leave.

680
00:25:35,527 --> 00:25:36,567
We'll have to wait here.

681
00:25:37,008 --> 00:25:37,688
Wait right here.

682
00:25:37,928 --> 00:25:38,728
We're not leaving.

683
00:25:38,888 --> 00:25:39,327
Wait here.

684
00:25:42,168 --> 00:25:42,968
Sit down and wait.

685
00:25:43,131 --> 00:25:46,598
(Di Liren)

686
00:25:48,527 --> 00:25:49,208
Hello, honey?

687
00:25:50,248 --> 00:25:51,567
Did you call the movers?

688
00:25:52,008 --> 00:25:53,047
What movers?

689
00:25:53,488 --> 00:25:55,168
Someone hired movers,

690
00:25:55,248 --> 00:25:56,567
and a bunch of men came.

691
00:25:57,248 --> 00:25:58,208
You didn't call

692
00:25:58,928 --> 00:25:59,847
to tell me that?

693
00:26:00,688 --> 00:26:01,728
I wanted to tell you

694
00:26:01,888 --> 00:26:03,327
that Jinghua's test report is out.

695
00:26:03,488 --> 00:26:04,448
I'm afraid you'll worry,

696
00:26:04,567 --> 00:26:05,928
so I forwarded it right away.

697
00:26:08,252 --> 00:26:09,878
(Jinghua's Test Report)

698
00:26:13,158 --> 00:26:16,095
(Pass)

699
00:26:26,287 --> 00:26:27,847
You really have your ways.

700
00:26:28,408 --> 00:26:29,607
As long as we align

701
00:26:30,248 --> 00:26:31,408
on the Jinghua project,

702
00:26:31,567 --> 00:26:33,208
who could possibly find fault with it?

703
00:26:33,688 --> 00:26:34,688
Luckily, you notified

704
00:26:34,807 --> 00:26:36,168
Lin Qiang in time

705
00:26:36,367 --> 00:26:38,127
to swap out the test samples,

706
00:26:38,488 --> 00:26:39,488
or it'd cause trouble.

707
00:26:40,488 --> 00:26:41,847
But why did you call the movers

708
00:26:41,968 --> 00:26:43,047
to your house

709
00:26:43,127 --> 00:26:43,847
at this hour?

710
00:26:44,807 --> 00:26:46,607
Aim for where it hurts most.

711
00:26:47,567 --> 00:26:48,688
I can't let her keep

712
00:26:48,807 --> 00:26:49,807
stirring up trouble.

713
00:26:51,367 --> 00:26:52,208
If she becomes

714
00:26:52,248 --> 00:26:53,567
someone with mental illness,

715
00:26:54,327 --> 00:26:55,688
who would ever believe

716
00:26:56,087 --> 00:26:57,248
anything she says?

717
00:27:00,807 --> 00:27:01,488
Liren,

718
00:27:02,448 --> 00:27:03,567
I heard rumors

719
00:27:04,008 --> 00:27:05,488
that Jiali went bankrupt,

720
00:27:06,248 --> 00:27:07,127
you and Meng

721
00:27:07,367 --> 00:27:09,408
tried to skip town
in the middle of the night.

722
00:27:10,488 --> 00:27:11,888
This is a misunderstanding.

723
00:27:15,567 --> 00:27:16,807
See what you've done.

724
00:27:17,728 --> 00:27:18,367
Meng asked me

725
00:27:18,367 --> 00:27:19,567
to hire the movers.

726
00:27:20,127 --> 00:27:20,767
Alright.

727
00:27:21,127 --> 00:27:22,607
Don't mention this again.

728
00:27:24,567 --> 00:27:25,448
Checked Dad's temperature

729
00:27:25,448 --> 00:27:26,408
and blood pressure?

730
00:27:26,688 --> 00:27:27,488
All normal.

731
00:27:30,527 --> 00:27:31,527
Here's the report.

732
00:27:32,728 --> 00:27:33,248
By the way,

733
00:27:33,448 --> 00:27:34,648
Meng left behind the meds

734
00:27:34,648 --> 00:27:35,767
from her psychiatry visit.

735
00:27:38,327 --> 00:27:39,287
Psychiatry?

736
00:27:39,642 --> 00:27:43,949
(Lithium Carbonate Tablets)

737
00:27:46,008 --> 00:27:46,847
What's up with her?

738
00:27:48,448 --> 00:27:49,168
Nothing.

739
00:27:51,127 --> 00:27:51,928
What happened?

740
00:27:52,648 --> 00:27:53,408
Tell me the truth.

741
00:27:54,008 --> 00:27:54,688
Ms. Hui,

742
00:27:55,168 --> 00:27:56,248
go fetch some hot water.

743
00:27:56,488 --> 00:27:57,047
Okay.

744
00:28:07,087 --> 00:28:08,168
Meng does have

745
00:28:10,888 --> 00:28:12,008
an issue in that area.

746
00:28:12,567 --> 00:28:13,168
It's my fault

747
00:28:13,847 --> 00:28:14,767
for neglecting her.

748
00:28:14,888 --> 00:28:15,688
She was fine.

749
00:28:16,127 --> 00:28:17,408
Why would she have this issue?

750
00:28:18,847 --> 00:28:20,087
I thought she was just

751
00:28:20,127 --> 00:28:21,327
throwing some temper.

752
00:28:22,688 --> 00:28:23,888
Then Dad fell ill.

753
00:28:24,607 --> 00:28:25,928
One day, I worked late

754
00:28:26,047 --> 00:28:27,047
and came a bit late.

755
00:28:27,807 --> 00:28:28,928
But Meng caused a scene

756
00:28:29,008 --> 00:28:30,047
right here,

757
00:28:30,367 --> 00:28:31,208
smashing things

758
00:28:31,248 --> 00:28:32,168
and throwing chairs.

759
00:28:32,607 --> 00:28:33,807
She insisted I cheated on her,

760
00:28:34,168 --> 00:28:35,448
and asked Dad to fire me,

761
00:28:36,127 --> 00:28:37,327
so she could be the chairman.

762
00:28:38,408 --> 00:28:39,008
What?

763
00:28:39,847 --> 00:28:40,928
That's ridiculous!

764
00:28:40,928 --> 00:28:42,287
Yu is still sick.

765
00:28:43,527 --> 00:28:45,327
Ms. Hui used to be a nurse.

766
00:28:46,248 --> 00:28:47,648
She noticed something's off

767
00:28:47,928 --> 00:28:49,408
and told me to get her checked out.

768
00:28:49,728 --> 00:28:50,408
Then we learned

769
00:28:50,728 --> 00:28:51,888
she is indeed sick.

770
00:28:52,208 --> 00:28:53,527
But Meng refuses to take her meds

771
00:28:53,688 --> 00:28:55,087
and denies being sick.

772
00:28:55,648 --> 00:28:56,728
Multiple times now,

773
00:28:57,047 --> 00:28:58,688
she denied things she'd said

774
00:28:58,807 --> 00:29:00,248
and forgot things she'd done.

775
00:29:02,767 --> 00:29:03,607
I...

776
00:29:03,688 --> 00:29:05,567
With my relationship with Yu,

777
00:29:06,208 --> 00:29:07,807
Meng is like a daughter to me.

778
00:29:08,968 --> 00:29:10,168
I won't just stand by.

779
00:29:10,767 --> 00:29:11,488
I'll talk to her.

780
00:29:12,008 --> 00:29:12,807
But she doesn't want

781
00:29:12,968 --> 00:29:13,648
others to know

782
00:29:13,767 --> 00:29:14,567
about her condition.

783
00:29:14,847 --> 00:29:15,408
Don't worry.

784
00:29:16,087 --> 00:29:16,767
I understand.

785
00:29:22,888 --> 00:29:23,448
Mr. Tian,

786
00:29:24,127 --> 00:29:25,567
if you didn't ask me to come

787
00:29:26,287 --> 00:29:27,527
to talk about work,

788
00:29:28,248 --> 00:29:29,087
then...

789
00:29:29,367 --> 00:29:30,087
Just have a meal

790
00:29:30,607 --> 00:29:31,367
and unwind.

791
00:29:31,767 --> 00:29:32,208
What?

792
00:29:32,367 --> 00:29:32,888
Can't we?

793
00:29:34,327 --> 00:29:35,047
Of course, we can.

794
00:29:35,448 --> 00:29:36,607
How is your mom doing lately?

795
00:29:37,327 --> 00:29:37,968
Pretty good.

796
00:29:38,807 --> 00:29:40,087
We video call every day,

797
00:29:40,408 --> 00:29:41,488
and she's much better now.

798
00:29:41,688 --> 00:29:42,888
Well, human

799
00:29:44,008 --> 00:29:45,008
needs rest.

800
00:29:46,488 --> 00:29:47,968
I think you should

801
00:29:48,327 --> 00:29:49,287
go to keep her company.

802
00:29:49,527 --> 00:29:50,327
Surrounded

803
00:29:51,127 --> 00:29:52,928
by mountains and waters,

804
00:29:53,607 --> 00:29:54,928
you could reset

805
00:29:54,928 --> 00:29:55,928
your body and mind.

806
00:29:56,648 --> 00:29:57,208
You might not

807
00:29:57,367 --> 00:29:58,488
even need the meds.

808
00:29:58,648 --> 00:29:59,127
Meds?

809
00:30:00,527 --> 00:30:01,327
What meds?

810
00:30:06,168 --> 00:30:06,888
Well,

811
00:30:07,807 --> 00:30:09,127
you young people nowadays

812
00:30:09,928 --> 00:30:11,847
are getting into wellness,

813
00:30:12,448 --> 00:30:14,248
taking all those

814
00:30:14,287 --> 00:30:15,607
supplements by the handful.

815
00:30:18,047 --> 00:30:18,688
Mr. Tian,

816
00:30:19,408 --> 00:30:20,648
did someone

817
00:30:21,168 --> 00:30:22,408
tell you something?

818
00:30:22,847 --> 00:30:23,408
No.

819
00:30:24,327 --> 00:30:25,688
I just remembered

820
00:30:26,527 --> 00:30:27,168
that my family

821
00:30:27,208 --> 00:30:28,527
went to New Zealand last year.

822
00:30:29,688 --> 00:30:30,968
Let me show you some photos.

823
00:30:32,527 --> 00:30:33,127
Look.

824
00:30:35,168 --> 00:30:37,648
The scenery there is gorgeous.

825
00:30:38,168 --> 00:30:38,928
I really think

826
00:30:39,008 --> 00:30:40,648
you should take your mom on a trip.

827
00:30:41,327 --> 00:30:41,847
Well,

828
00:30:42,847 --> 00:30:43,728
I'll send

829
00:30:43,767 --> 00:30:44,888
our itinerary last year

830
00:30:45,008 --> 00:30:45,728
to you.

831
00:30:47,168 --> 00:30:47,928
Thank you.

832
00:30:48,287 --> 00:30:49,248
But lately,

833
00:30:49,527 --> 00:30:50,448
I don't have the time.

834
00:30:51,047 --> 00:30:51,688
What is it, Mom?

835
00:30:51,888 --> 00:30:53,448
Did you go for your follow-up today?

836
00:30:54,287 --> 00:30:55,287
What did Dr. Zhou say?

837
00:30:56,408 --> 00:30:57,047
Don't worry.

838
00:30:57,248 --> 00:30:58,127
Everything looks fine.

839
00:30:58,527 --> 00:30:58,968
Look.

840
00:30:59,208 --> 00:31:00,127
I just stepped out.

841
00:31:00,648 --> 00:31:01,008
Look.

842
00:31:02,847 --> 00:31:03,287
Good.

843
00:31:03,807 --> 00:31:05,047
I also asked Dr. Zhou

844
00:31:05,127 --> 00:31:06,807
to give you a full physical checkup.

845
00:31:07,527 --> 00:31:08,527
Just do it.

846
00:31:08,767 --> 00:31:09,527
Don't rush back.

847
00:31:09,847 --> 00:31:11,367
I'll book your return ticket later.

848
00:31:12,567 --> 00:31:13,408
Alright, got it.

849
00:31:13,728 --> 00:31:14,648
I want to stay

850
00:31:14,728 --> 00:31:15,248
a bit longer.

851
00:31:15,527 --> 00:31:16,928
Mr. Tian asked me out suddenly.

852
00:31:17,448 --> 00:31:18,327
Di Liren must have

853
00:31:18,367 --> 00:31:19,168
told him something.

854
00:31:20,208 --> 00:31:21,567
Looks like he's terrified

855
00:31:22,047 --> 00:31:23,567
I'll take back my signing authority,

856
00:31:23,767 --> 00:31:25,047
so he's trying hard to stop me.

857
00:31:25,367 --> 00:31:26,767
We need to change our approach.

858
00:31:27,408 --> 00:31:28,928
What other excuse do you have

859
00:31:29,168 --> 00:31:30,448
to return to Jiali?

860
00:31:31,327 --> 00:31:31,928
And Harry?

861
00:31:32,607 --> 00:31:33,327
Why no news

862
00:31:33,367 --> 00:31:34,047
on Harry lately?

863
00:31:34,367 --> 00:31:35,448
In Beijing for a follow-up.

864
00:31:35,888 --> 00:31:36,807
He even sent me

865
00:31:36,928 --> 00:31:37,928
his medical records.

866
00:31:40,408 --> 00:31:41,208
To be honest,

867
00:31:41,527 --> 00:31:42,287
with him gone,

868
00:31:42,728 --> 00:31:43,688
I worry Lu Hui

869
00:31:43,728 --> 00:31:45,168
might run off with my money anytime.

870
00:31:46,008 --> 00:31:47,367
Once Lu Hui runs,

871
00:31:47,567 --> 00:31:49,008
Di Liren will vanish immediately.

872
00:31:49,208 --> 00:31:50,008
Now I suspect

873
00:31:50,087 --> 00:31:51,008
they might have

874
00:31:51,047 --> 00:31:51,968
a disagreement on this.

875
00:31:54,527 --> 00:31:55,208
How so?

876
00:32:02,127 --> 00:32:03,607
I'm in a good mood. No need to pay.

877
00:32:03,928 --> 00:32:04,527
It's on me.

878
00:32:07,168 --> 00:32:08,408
Before this,

879
00:32:08,408 --> 00:32:09,527
I understood why Di Liren

880
00:32:09,567 --> 00:32:10,248
wanted to gamble.

881
00:32:10,688 --> 00:32:11,928
If he could take over Jiali,

882
00:32:12,527 --> 00:32:14,127
he could siphon off more money.

883
00:32:14,807 --> 00:32:15,767
But I didn't expect

884
00:32:15,767 --> 00:32:17,292
your dad
to give the signing authority to you,

885
00:32:17,728 --> 00:32:19,087
which put him on the back foot.

886
00:32:19,648 --> 00:32:20,888
His best move right now

887
00:32:20,888 --> 00:32:21,847
is to flee with money.

888
00:32:21,847 --> 00:32:22,488
Yet,

889
00:32:23,448 --> 00:32:24,047
he hasn't.

890
00:32:24,448 --> 00:32:25,527
Maybe Lu Hui is the one

891
00:32:25,567 --> 00:32:26,408
who wants to flee,

892
00:32:26,928 --> 00:32:27,807
not Di Liren.

893
00:32:28,367 --> 00:32:29,408
He's far more ambitious.

894
00:32:30,767 --> 00:32:32,208
Then what exactly is he after?

895
00:32:35,488 --> 00:32:36,488
Jiali's equity?

896
00:32:38,047 --> 00:32:39,367
Whatever he's after,

897
00:32:39,767 --> 00:32:40,567
we can only focus on

898
00:32:40,607 --> 00:32:41,448
what's at hand.

899
00:32:41,728 --> 00:32:43,208
Only by digging into Jinghua

900
00:32:43,367 --> 00:32:44,567
can we get leverage on him.

901
00:32:46,127 --> 00:32:47,127
On one hand,

902
00:32:47,488 --> 00:32:48,648
I need to find a way

903
00:32:48,928 --> 00:32:50,287
to get back to the company.

904
00:32:50,688 --> 00:32:51,807
On the other hand,

905
00:32:51,968 --> 00:32:53,047
I need to figure out

906
00:32:53,127 --> 00:32:54,567
how Han Guang and Di Liren

907
00:32:54,807 --> 00:32:55,728
managed to rig

908
00:32:55,767 --> 00:32:56,607
this test.

909
00:32:57,168 --> 00:32:57,847
I must take back

910
00:32:57,928 --> 00:32:58,968
the real test report.

911
00:32:59,807 --> 00:33:01,008
Who else is involved in

912
00:33:01,047 --> 00:33:02,047
the production process

913
00:33:02,367 --> 00:33:02,968
and might know

914
00:33:03,008 --> 00:33:04,127
the adulteration?

915
00:33:09,648 --> 00:33:10,527
The OEM factory head.

916
00:33:15,408 --> 00:33:16,087
Mr. Di,

917
00:33:16,488 --> 00:33:18,248
our factory suffered a lot of loss.

918
00:33:18,888 --> 00:33:20,527
You can't just brush this off.

919
00:33:23,767 --> 00:33:25,488
We'll have plenty
of chances to cooperate.

920
00:33:26,367 --> 00:33:27,767
I'll offer more profit next time.

921
00:33:28,047 --> 00:33:28,648
How about that?

922
00:33:29,367 --> 00:33:30,208
Let's have a toast.

923
00:33:30,688 --> 00:33:31,728
To you and Mr. Han.

924
00:33:34,968 --> 00:33:35,607
Waiter.

925
00:33:35,968 --> 00:33:37,408
Open the other bottle too.

926
00:33:38,527 --> 00:33:39,847
I'm so sorry.

927
00:33:40,248 --> 00:33:41,567
Traffic was terrible today,

928
00:33:41,728 --> 00:33:42,327
so I'm late.

929
00:33:42,448 --> 00:33:43,168
Why are you here?

930
00:33:44,367 --> 00:33:45,087
Honey,

931
00:33:45,408 --> 00:33:46,688
you're treating to apologize,

932
00:33:46,847 --> 00:33:48,047
yet with no good wine.

933
00:33:48,527 --> 00:33:49,208
Once I heard it,

934
00:33:49,327 --> 00:33:50,248
I hurried home

935
00:33:50,367 --> 00:33:51,567
and grabbed two nice bottles.

936
00:33:54,367 --> 00:33:54,847
Mr. Han.

937
00:33:59,248 --> 00:34:00,248
And this is...

938
00:34:01,968 --> 00:34:02,888
This is Guangsili'er

939
00:34:02,928 --> 00:34:03,767
OEM factory head,

940
00:34:04,008 --> 00:34:04,567
Lin Qiang.

941
00:34:06,928 --> 00:34:07,448
Hello,

942
00:34:07,527 --> 00:34:08,087
Mr. Lin.

943
00:34:08,408 --> 00:34:09,808
So it's you who audited our books.

944
00:34:10,127 --> 00:34:11,288
Look at the mess you caused.

945
00:34:11,567 --> 00:34:13,247
Not only is my entire factory

946
00:34:13,488 --> 00:34:14,567
living in fear,

947
00:34:14,768 --> 00:34:15,567
our other partners

948
00:34:15,647 --> 00:34:16,888
are getting paranoid now.

949
00:34:17,247 --> 00:34:18,647
Some even canceled their orders!

950
00:34:18,968 --> 00:34:19,527
Do you know

951
00:34:19,527 --> 00:34:20,647
how much loss we suffer?

952
00:34:22,368 --> 00:34:23,008
Mr. Lin,

953
00:34:23,567 --> 00:34:24,448
don't get agitated.

954
00:34:26,768 --> 00:34:27,768
Tell me

955
00:34:28,408 --> 00:34:29,328
the desired solution.

956
00:34:30,127 --> 00:34:30,848
Compensate us!

957
00:34:31,888 --> 00:34:32,647
Compensate you?

958
00:34:34,167 --> 00:34:34,768
Sure.

959
00:34:36,207 --> 00:34:36,848
How much?

960
00:34:38,687 --> 00:34:39,647
However,

961
00:34:40,127 --> 00:34:41,328
I hope you

962
00:34:41,687 --> 00:34:42,647
think this through.

963
00:34:43,888 --> 00:34:45,047
Can you really afford

964
00:34:45,127 --> 00:34:46,207
Jiali's compensation?

965
00:34:46,607 --> 00:34:47,607
Demanding quality testing

966
00:34:47,647 --> 00:34:48,727
for our products

967
00:34:49,047 --> 00:34:50,488
is in accordance with the contract.

968
00:34:51,047 --> 00:34:52,008
If you insist,

969
00:34:52,448 --> 00:34:53,727
I can submit a request

970
00:34:53,808 --> 00:34:54,448
to the board.

971
00:34:55,087 --> 00:34:56,607
But whether the board agrees

972
00:34:56,687 --> 00:34:57,768
to pay,

973
00:34:57,848 --> 00:34:58,647
or suspends

974
00:34:58,727 --> 00:34:59,687
our partnership

975
00:34:59,928 --> 00:35:00,888
over this,

976
00:35:02,127 --> 00:35:03,207
that's out of my hands.

977
00:35:05,448 --> 00:35:06,087
Mr. Lin,

978
00:35:07,368 --> 00:35:08,247
no need for that.

979
00:35:08,328 --> 00:35:09,087
I brought you here

980
00:35:09,127 --> 00:35:10,687
just to introduce you to Mr. Di.

981
00:35:11,288 --> 00:35:12,047
The Jinghua matter

982
00:35:12,167 --> 00:35:12,928
is in the past.

983
00:35:13,207 --> 00:35:14,167
If you insist on

984
00:35:14,328 --> 00:35:15,448
compensation,

985
00:35:15,768 --> 00:35:16,727
it'll hurt our trust.

986
00:35:17,368 --> 00:35:19,288
Are you really going to go after Meng?

987
00:35:19,888 --> 00:35:20,567
Besides,

988
00:35:20,928 --> 00:35:22,607
Meng did nothing wrong.

989
00:35:22,848 --> 00:35:23,768
We're all trying

990
00:35:23,808 --> 00:35:25,127
to ensure the product's quality.

991
00:35:27,727 --> 00:35:28,928
Mr. Han is right.

992
00:35:30,328 --> 00:35:31,768
Meng meant well.

993
00:35:32,288 --> 00:35:33,808
If we had let it slide,

994
00:35:34,368 --> 00:35:35,408
and word leaked out,

995
00:35:35,768 --> 00:35:37,047
the damage to both our brands

996
00:35:37,167 --> 00:35:38,167
would've been much worse.

997
00:35:46,768 --> 00:35:47,368
Ms. Yu,

998
00:35:47,768 --> 00:35:48,768
I drank a bit too much,

999
00:35:49,408 --> 00:35:50,567
and spoke out of turn.

1000
00:35:51,207 --> 00:35:52,008
I apologize.

1001
00:35:52,768 --> 00:35:53,288
I'm sorry.

1002
00:35:54,047 --> 00:35:54,888
I'll finish this pot.

1003
00:35:59,127 --> 00:36:00,288
Alright, Mr. Lin.

1004
00:36:00,488 --> 00:36:01,687
Meng is like my own sister.

1005
00:36:01,768 --> 00:36:02,647
She won't blame you.

1006
00:36:03,047 --> 00:36:03,527
Make sure

1007
00:36:03,607 --> 00:36:05,087
to watch your words.

1008
00:36:05,727 --> 00:36:06,647
Anyway,

1009
00:36:07,008 --> 00:36:08,207
the sender of that email

1010
00:36:08,368 --> 00:36:10,247
is the one who should be held liable.

1011
00:36:10,448 --> 00:36:11,047
Good point.

1012
00:36:12,247 --> 00:36:13,448
Where did he get

1013
00:36:13,527 --> 00:36:14,368
the samples,

1014
00:36:14,928 --> 00:36:16,607
and where were they tested?

1015
00:36:17,047 --> 00:36:18,247
Did he do all this

1016
00:36:18,328 --> 00:36:19,567
with ulterior motives

1017
00:36:20,008 --> 00:36:21,207
just to extort us?

1018
00:36:21,527 --> 00:36:22,207
We have no idea.

1019
00:36:22,527 --> 00:36:23,607
It's worth digging into.

1020
00:36:25,368 --> 00:36:26,368
I don't think so.

1021
00:36:27,408 --> 00:36:27,968
Right now,

1022
00:36:27,968 --> 00:36:29,087
we don't have any evidence.

1023
00:36:29,647 --> 00:36:31,328
Digging into it might cause a stir.

1024
00:36:31,488 --> 00:36:32,008
As

1025
00:36:32,047 --> 00:36:33,488
a content creator,

1026
00:36:33,768 --> 00:36:35,087
it will backfire online.

1027
00:36:36,167 --> 00:36:38,047
Meng, I know you're kind.

1028
00:36:38,247 --> 00:36:38,888
But whoever

1029
00:36:38,888 --> 00:36:40,328
smeared our product's quality

1030
00:36:40,527 --> 00:36:41,647
must have bad intentions.

1031
00:36:41,888 --> 00:36:43,008
I'm not being kind,

1032
00:36:43,127 --> 00:36:44,448
but considering the big picture.

1033
00:36:45,247 --> 00:36:46,008
If this person

1034
00:36:46,087 --> 00:36:47,167
truly intended to smear us,

1035
00:36:47,288 --> 00:36:47,768
why sent

1036
00:36:47,768 --> 00:36:48,888
an internal email?

1037
00:36:49,047 --> 00:36:49,647
He could've

1038
00:36:49,727 --> 00:36:50,647
publicized it.

1039
00:36:51,087 --> 00:36:52,127
Just because we don't know

1040
00:36:52,288 --> 00:36:53,607
what he wants,

1041
00:36:53,727 --> 00:36:55,047
we need to track him down.

1042
00:36:55,647 --> 00:36:56,207
Honey,

1043
00:36:56,768 --> 00:36:57,687
you're so objecting,

1044
00:36:57,888 --> 00:36:58,567
do you

1045
00:36:59,008 --> 00:36:59,768
know who it is?

1046
00:37:02,288 --> 00:37:03,167
Hello, everyone.

1047
00:37:03,328 --> 00:37:04,928
I'm today's Emotional Detective.

1048
00:37:06,247 --> 00:37:06,687
Today,

1049
00:37:06,968 --> 00:37:07,968
our submission

1050
00:37:08,087 --> 00:37:09,008
comes from a lady.

1051
00:37:09,768 --> 00:37:11,087
Let me read her story first.

1052
00:37:13,448 --> 00:37:14,527
She says

1053
00:37:14,888 --> 00:37:17,087
she's been married for three years.

1054
00:37:17,768 --> 00:37:19,127
When she first met him...

1055
00:37:21,687 --> 00:37:22,570
(Someone's knocking?)

1056
00:37:23,368 --> 00:37:24,647
(Go check it out.)

1057
00:37:25,328 --> 00:37:26,247
(So noisy.)

1058
00:37:26,928 --> 00:37:27,488
Wait a second.

1059
00:37:27,647 --> 00:37:28,328
I'll go check.

1060
00:37:31,527 --> 00:37:32,247
Who is it?

1061
00:37:34,928 --> 00:37:35,607
Police.

1062
00:37:37,087 --> 00:37:38,127
You're Liu Bai, right?

1063
00:37:38,768 --> 00:37:40,047
We're investigating a case.

1064
00:37:40,408 --> 00:37:41,207
Please come with us.

1065
00:37:42,647 --> 00:37:43,368
(What's going on?)

1066
00:37:43,968 --> 00:37:44,888
(Where did Host go?)

1067
00:37:45,687 --> 00:37:47,488
(Rumor says he got arrested!)

1068
00:37:47,968 --> 00:37:48,768
(Really?)

1069
00:37:50,127 --> 00:37:51,047
(That's huge!)

1070
00:37:54,008 --> 00:37:55,408
In such a fun live stream,

1071
00:37:55,647 --> 00:37:57,288
he got arrested just like that.

1072
00:37:57,727 --> 00:37:58,768
It's just the beginning.

1073
00:37:59,647 --> 00:38:01,167
I'm not just making the whole company

1074
00:38:01,368 --> 00:38:03,328
think she's crazy.

1075
00:38:03,848 --> 00:38:05,008
I'm also going to get rid of

1076
00:38:05,047 --> 00:38:05,808
those around her.

1077
00:38:06,527 --> 00:38:07,247
Dong Jun,

1078
00:38:07,607 --> 00:38:08,607
Liu Bai, and Liu Zi.

1079
00:38:09,247 --> 00:38:10,368
I want her to end up

1080
00:38:10,527 --> 00:38:12,087
with no one but me.

1081
00:38:13,247 --> 00:38:14,127
Luckily, I'm

1082
00:38:14,167 --> 00:38:15,207
on your side.

1083
00:38:21,607 --> 00:38:22,207
Mr. Chen,

1084
00:38:22,647 --> 00:38:23,087
hello.

1085
00:38:23,848 --> 00:38:24,687
This is Di Liren.

1086
00:38:25,288 --> 00:38:26,488
We spoke earlier.

1087
00:38:26,768 --> 00:38:27,328
I got it.

1088
00:38:27,567 --> 00:38:28,408
Thank you then.

1089
00:38:29,167 --> 00:38:29,527
Meng.

1090
00:38:29,527 --> 00:38:30,207
What's with him?

1091
00:38:30,527 --> 00:38:31,808
Three days in criminal detention.

1092
00:38:31,808 --> 00:38:32,968
Di Liren has pressed charges.

1093
00:38:33,768 --> 00:38:34,768
That scumbag!

1094
00:38:36,888 --> 00:38:37,527
Wait,

1095
00:38:38,087 --> 00:38:38,808
I knew Di Liren

1096
00:38:38,888 --> 00:38:39,808
might go to the police,

1097
00:38:40,047 --> 00:38:40,928
so I had Jiao Xu

1098
00:38:40,928 --> 00:38:42,008
close every legal loophole.

1099
00:38:42,448 --> 00:38:43,727
What charges did he press?

1100
00:38:44,087 --> 00:38:44,808
Extortion.

1101
00:38:45,127 --> 00:38:46,087
How do you know?

1102
00:38:46,527 --> 00:38:47,247
The lawyer Di Liren hired

1103
00:38:47,247 --> 00:38:47,768
is from our firm.

1104
00:38:47,888 --> 00:38:48,527
I just knew it.

1105
00:38:48,848 --> 00:38:49,968
He hired from your firm?

1106
00:38:50,207 --> 00:38:50,968
Then you couldn't

1107
00:38:50,968 --> 00:38:52,167
represent Liu Bai.

1108
00:38:53,607 --> 00:38:54,047
Right.

1109
00:38:54,567 --> 00:38:55,087
Criminal case

1110
00:38:55,207 --> 00:38:56,247
isn't my specialty anyway,

1111
00:38:56,328 --> 00:38:57,328
I can refer you to one.

1112
00:38:57,928 --> 00:38:58,687
You read that email

1113
00:38:58,928 --> 00:39:00,127
carefully, didn't you?

1114
00:39:00,328 --> 00:39:01,928
Liu Bai never took money from him.

1115
00:39:02,247 --> 00:39:02,888
Why would it

1116
00:39:02,888 --> 00:39:03,808
be extortion?

1117
00:39:04,848 --> 00:39:05,607
Remember that deal

1118
00:39:05,687 --> 00:39:06,687
Liu Bai took earlier?

1119
00:39:07,127 --> 00:39:07,687
What about it?

1120
00:39:08,127 --> 00:39:09,047
It wasn't a real deal.

1121
00:39:09,328 --> 00:39:10,247
The money wired to him

1122
00:39:10,288 --> 00:39:11,567
was from a Di Liren's account.

1123
00:39:11,607 --> 00:39:12,527
Now Di Liren insists

1124
00:39:12,567 --> 00:39:13,448
he was extorted.

1125
00:39:13,808 --> 00:39:14,607
And he provided

1126
00:39:14,607 --> 00:39:16,047
surveillance footage
of Liu Bai following him,

1127
00:39:16,288 --> 00:39:17,368
claiming Liu Bai demanded

1128
00:39:17,408 --> 00:39:18,247
hush money,

1129
00:39:18,247 --> 00:39:19,647
disguised as a deal payment.

1130
00:39:19,768 --> 00:39:20,567
Shameless!

1131
00:39:21,727 --> 00:39:22,368
Calm down.

1132
00:39:22,968 --> 00:39:24,008
We walked into a trap,

1133
00:39:24,207 --> 00:39:24,768
but we still

1134
00:39:24,848 --> 00:39:25,687
have plenty of room

1135
00:39:25,687 --> 00:39:26,288
for defense.

1136
00:39:28,968 --> 00:39:30,488
Three angles in cases like this.

1137
00:39:30,687 --> 00:39:31,127
First,

1138
00:39:31,368 --> 00:39:32,968
prove it's a real business deal.

1139
00:39:33,167 --> 00:39:33,928
Contracts

1140
00:39:34,008 --> 00:39:34,848
and chat logs

1141
00:39:34,968 --> 00:39:36,047
can prove the payment

1142
00:39:36,087 --> 00:39:37,087
isn't hush money.

1143
00:39:37,527 --> 00:39:38,047
Second,

1144
00:39:38,207 --> 00:39:39,328
challenge their evidence.

1145
00:39:39,647 --> 00:39:41,047
Can they prove

1146
00:39:41,127 --> 00:39:42,127
that you showed

1147
00:39:42,127 --> 00:39:42,888
any threats?

1148
00:39:43,288 --> 00:39:44,687
Third, expose their motive.

1149
00:39:45,047 --> 00:39:45,607
For instance,

1150
00:39:45,647 --> 00:39:46,687
are they using the lawsuit

1151
00:39:46,768 --> 00:39:48,127
to cover up something else?

1152
00:39:48,288 --> 00:39:48,808
Is that it?

1153
00:39:50,368 --> 00:39:50,808
Okay.

1154
00:39:51,127 --> 00:39:51,687
I thought

1155
00:39:51,687 --> 00:39:53,167
since you took the plaintiff's case,

1156
00:39:53,247 --> 00:39:54,127
you couldn't

1157
00:39:54,127 --> 00:39:55,047
help the defense.

1158
00:39:55,127 --> 00:39:55,888
I never did that.

1159
00:39:56,247 --> 00:39:56,848
I was shooting

1160
00:39:56,888 --> 00:39:57,808
a legal video.

1161
00:39:58,408 --> 00:39:59,968
As for any slight resemblance

1162
00:40:00,087 --> 00:40:01,808
between the video and this case,

1163
00:40:02,848 --> 00:40:03,567
I had no idea.

1164
00:40:04,087 --> 00:40:05,008
Must be a coincidence.

1165
00:40:07,968 --> 00:40:08,928
Look on the bright side.

1166
00:40:09,008 --> 00:40:09,808
It will all pass.

1167
00:40:10,567 --> 00:40:11,247
Let's go eat.

1168
00:40:11,408 --> 00:40:12,247
You can tell me more

1169
00:40:12,288 --> 00:40:13,008
about the Lius.

1170
00:40:13,288 --> 00:40:14,087
I'll think of a way.

1171
00:40:15,647 --> 00:40:16,712
What would you like to eat?

1172
00:40:16,928 --> 00:40:17,848
- Anything.
- Mr. Jiao.

1173
00:40:18,008 --> 00:40:18,727
Anything is fine.

1174
00:40:21,127 --> 00:40:21,768
Honey?

1175
00:40:22,247 --> 00:40:23,047
Why are you here?

1176
00:40:27,752 --> 00:40:30,453
=The Vanishing Beauty=
(Next Episode Preview)

1177
00:40:32,488 --> 00:40:33,247
Not this one.

1178
00:40:34,488 --> 00:40:35,408
Pick another one.

1179
00:40:35,408 --> 00:40:36,087
Any other.

1180
00:40:37,488 --> 00:40:38,167
(Weng Xin)
Weng Xin.

1181
00:40:39,247 --> 00:40:40,127
(No answer)
How do you

1182
00:40:40,527 --> 00:40:41,167
deal with this?

1183
00:40:41,768 --> 00:40:43,087
You had me trade it for earrings.

1184
00:40:43,328 --> 00:40:44,368
Keep it if you like it.

1185
00:40:44,808 --> 00:40:45,968
